# prefix-block-mixed-values

## Input

```
block.
  str hello world
  num 42
  flag true
  neg -1
  quoted "value"
  text |
    multi
    line

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..100
  PREFIX_BLOCK@0..100
    WORD_KEY@0..6
      WORD@0..6 "block."
    NEWLINE@6..7 "\n"
    SPACE@7..9 "  "
    ENTRY@9..25
      WORD_KEY@9..12
        WORD@9..12 "str"
      SPACE@12..13 " "
      LINE_STRING@13..24
        STRING@13..24 "hello world"
      NEWLINE@24..25 "\n"
    SPACE@25..27 "  "
    ENTRY@27..34
      WORD_KEY@27..30
        WORD@27..30 "num"
      SPACE@30..31 " "
      INTEGER@31..33
        NUMERAL@31..33 "42"
      NEWLINE@33..34 "\n"
    SPACE@34..36 "  "
    ENTRY@36..46
      WORD_KEY@36..40
        WORD@36..40 "flag"
      SPACE@40..41 " "
      BOOLEAN@41..45
        TRUE@41..45 "true"
      NEWLINE@45..46 "\n"
    SPACE@46..48 "  "
    ENTRY@48..55
      WORD_KEY@48..51
        WORD@48..51 "neg"
      SPACE@51..52 " "
      INTEGER@52..54
        MINUS@52..53 "-"
        NUMERAL@53..54 "1"
      NEWLINE@54..55 "\n"
    SPACE@55..57 "  "
    ENTRY@57..72
      WORD_KEY@57..63
        WORD@57..63 "quoted"
      SPACE@63..64 " "
      QUOTED_STRING@64..71
        DOUBLE_QUOTE@64..65 "\""
        STRING@65..70 "value"
        DOUBLE_QUOTE@70..71 "\""
      NEWLINE@71..72 "\n"
    SPACE@72..74 "  "
    ENTRY@74..100
      WORD_KEY@74..78
        WORD@74..78 "text"
      SPACE@78..79 " "
      BLOCK_STRING@79..100
        BLOCK_STRING_HEADER@79..81
          PIPE@79..80 "|"
          NEWLINE@80..81 "\n"
        SPACE@81..85 "    "
        LINE_STRING@85..90
          STRING@85..90 "multi"
        NEWLINE@90..91 "\n"
        SPACE@91..95 "    "
        LINE_STRING@95..99
          STRING@95..99 "line"
        NEWLINE@99..100 "\n"
```

